{
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "description": "Host NVLink lanes, actionable errors, services, GPU fabric registration, NVSwitch inventory and sweep health.",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [
    {
      "icon": "home",
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": true,
      "targetBlank": false,
      "title": "\u2302 IREN_MKZ Home",
      "tooltip": "Back to IREN_MKZ Home",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/iren_mkz-home?${__url_time_range}"
    },
    {
      "asDropdown": true,
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": true,
      "tags": [
        "iren_mkz"
      ],
      "title": "IREN_MKZ Dashboards",
      "type": "dashboards"
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "description": "Purpose, evidence semantics, and routes to adjacent IREN_MKZ dashboards.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "# IREN_MKZ \u2014 NVLink & NVSwitch Fabric\n\n**Fleet readiness plus selected-tray lane evidence.** The `su1_` prefix is a collector namespace\u2014not SU1 scope. FEC and BER-like counters are not given naive non-zero alerts; actionable error kinds use selected-range increases.\n\n[Home](/d/iren_mkz-home?${__url_time_range}) \u00b7 [Command Center](/d/iren_mkz-command-center?${__url_time_range}) \u00b7 [Live Topology](/d/iren_mkz-topology?${__url_time_range}) \u00b7 [Infrastructure](/d/iren_mkz-infrastructure?${__url_time_range}) \u00b7 [GPU & NVLink](/d/iren_mkz-accelerators?${__url_time_range}) \u00b7 [Fabric, CVT & Cabling](/d/iren_mkz-fabric?${__url_time_range}) \u00b7 [Workloads, Slurm & Validation](/d/iren_mkz-workloads?${__url_time_range})",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "",
      "transparent": true,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "description": "NVLink and NVSwitch decisions",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "id": 2,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "NVLink and NVSwitch decisions",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Distinct trays with at least one live NVLink lane series.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "count(count by(node)(su1_nvlink_up{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\"}))",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Trays reporting lanes",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Trays reporting other than the expected 72 host NVLink lane series.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 4,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "count(count by(node)(su1_nvlink_up{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\"}) != 72)",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Trays not at 72 lanes",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Exact current host-side NVLink lanes whose up state is zero.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "count(su1_nvlink_up{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\"} == 0) or on() (count(su1_nvlink_up{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\"}) * 0)",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Lanes DOWN",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "GPU PCI fabric-registration states not equal to completed (1). Fleet-wide value 0 is under collector-semantic investigation and is not promoted to a critical GPU fault.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 6,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "count(su1_gpu_fabric_state{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\"} != 1) or on() (count(su1_gpu_fabric_state{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\"}) * 0)",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Fabric state \u2260 1 \u00b7 semantic",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Trays where the live NVIDIA IMEX service state is inactive.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 7,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "count(su1_service_active{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\",service=\"nvidia-imex\"} == 0) or on() (count(su1_service_active{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\",service=\"nvidia-imex\"}) * 0)",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "IMEX inactive",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Unique NVSwitch inventory endpoints unreachable or unhealthy.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 20,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 8,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "count(max by(switch)((switch_up{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\",kind=\"nvswitch\"} == 0) or (switch_health{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\",kind=\"nvswitch\"} != 1))) or on() (count(switch_up{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\",kind=\"nvswitch\"}) * 0)",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "NVSwitch needs action",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "description": "Fleet lane coverage, selected tray and switch inventory",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "id": 9,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Fleet lane coverage, selected tray and switch inventory",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Every tray reporting other than 72 lanes; missing entire-tray telemetry is listed separately in GPU & NVLink.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            },
            "filterable": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "node"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "links",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "targetBlank": false,
                    "title": "Open tray root cause",
                    "url": "/d/iren_mkz-tray-root-cause?var-node=${__data.fields.node}&${__url_time_range}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "id": 10,
      "options": {
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        },
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "desc": true,
            "displayName": "Lanes"
          }
        ]
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "count by(node,rack,su)(su1_nvlink_up{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\"}) != 72",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Trays with incomplete lane coverage",
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "cluster": true,
              "instance": true,
              "job": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value": "Lanes"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "sortBy",
          "options": {
            "sort": [
              {
                "desc": true,
                "field": "Lanes"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "type": "table"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Exact down or slow lanes on the selected tray, joined on GPU/lane rather than lane number alone. Empty is meaningful only when that tray has a lane roster.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            },
            "filterable": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Up"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "short"
              },
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "options": {
                      "0": {
                        "color": "red",
                        "text": "DOWN"
                      },
                      "1": {
                        "color": "green",
                        "text": "UP"
                      }
                    },
                    "type": "value"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "basic",
                  "type": "color-background"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Speed"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "GBs"
              },
              {
                "id": "decimals",
                "value": 3
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 10
      },
      "id": 11,
      "options": {
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        },
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "label_join(su1_nvlink_up{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\",node=~\"$node\"} == 0, \"entity\", \"/\", \"gpu\", \"link\")",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "label_join(su1_nvlink_speed_gbps{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\",node=~\"$node\"} < 53.125, \"entity\", \"/\", \"gpu\", \"link\")",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Selected-tray lane exceptions \u2014 $node",
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "joinByField",
          "options": {
            "byField": "entity",
            "mode": "outer"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "cluster": true,
              "entity": true,
              "instance": true,
              "job": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value #A": "Up",
              "Value #B": "Speed"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "type": "table"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "NVSwitch inventory endpoints currently unreachable or unhealthy. Click for reachability, firmware and rack evidence.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            },
            "filterable": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "switch"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "links",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "targetBlank": false,
                    "title": "Open switch root cause",
                    "url": "/d/iren_mkz-switch-root-cause?var-switch=${__data.fields.switch}&var-kind=${__data.fields.kind}&var-rack=${__data.fields.rack}&${__url_time_range}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 10
      },
      "id": 12,
      "options": {
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        },
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "topk(100, switch_info{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\",kind=\"nvswitch\"} and on(switch) max by(switch)((switch_up{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\",kind=\"nvswitch\"} == 0) or (switch_health{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\",kind=\"nvswitch\"} != 1)))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "NVSwitch inventory needing action",
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Evidence": true,
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "cluster": true,
              "component": true,
              "instance": true,
              "job": true,
              "plane": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value": "Evidence"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "type": "table"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "description": "Selected-tray actionable errors and chronology",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20
      },
      "id": 13,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Selected-tray actionable errors and chronology",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Selected-range increases for actionable integrity, symbol, RX, recovery-failure and discard counters on the selected tray. BER/FEC parser values are excluded.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            },
            "filterable": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "gpu"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "links",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "targetBlank": false,
                    "title": "Open hosting GPU evidence",
                    "url": "/d/iren_mkz-gpu-root-cause?var-node=$node&var-gpu=${__data.fields.gpu}&${__url_time_range}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 21
      },
      "id": 14,
      "options": {
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        },
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "desc": true,
            "displayName": "Increase"
          }
        ]
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "topk(100, sum by(node,gpu,link,kind)(increase(su1_nvlink_error_total{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\",node=~\"$node\",kind=~\"local_link_integrity_errors|symbol_errors|rx_errors|rx_remote_errors|link_recovery_failed_events|tx_discards\"}[$__range]))) > 0",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Actionable NVLink error changes \u2014 $node",
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "cluster": true,
              "instance": true,
              "job": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value": "Increase"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "sortBy",
          "options": {
            "sort": [
              {
                "desc": true,
                "field": "Increase"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "type": "table"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "IMEX/Fabric Manager service state and GPU fabric registration for the selected tray. Fabric Manager inactivity is evidence, not automatically a fault until the intended service profile is confirmed.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            },
            "filterable": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Service active"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "short"
              },
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "options": {
                      "0": {
                        "color": "red",
                        "text": "DOWN"
                      },
                      "1": {
                        "color": "green",
                        "text": "UP"
                      }
                    },
                    "type": "value"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "basic",
                  "type": "color-background"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Fabric completed"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "short"
              },
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "options": {
                      "0": {
                        "color": "red",
                        "text": "DOWN"
                      },
                      "1": {
                        "color": "green",
                        "text": "UP"
                      }
                    },
                    "type": "value"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
